OL,3,CWales No.1 Gerwyn Price to face Luke
OL,4,CLittler in World Matchplay darts final
OL,6,FWales' new No.1 darts player, Gerwyn
OL,7,FPrice, will take on defending champion
OL,8,FLuke Littler in the World Matchplay
OL,9,Ffinal in Blackpool on Sunday (26 July).
OL,11,FThe former world champion secured his
OL,12,Fplace after beating Netherlands' Gian
OL,13,Fvan Veen 17-10 on Saturday (25 July)
OL,14,Fin the semi-finals.
OL,16,FKnown to his fans as the 'Iceman',
OL,17,FPrice was last in the World Matchplay
OL,18,Ffinal in 2022 - but has never lifted
OL,19,Fthe Phil Taylor trophy.
