CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1785251894
OL,3,CWales No.1 Gerwyn Price to face Luke
OL,4,CLittler in World Matchplay darts final
OL,6,FGerwyn's success in the tournament has
OL,7,Fmeant he has become Wales' top darts
OL,8,Fplayer, overtaking former Welsh no.1
OL,9,FJonny Clayton.
OL,11,FLuke Littler has won the past nine
OL,12,Fencounters between the pair, with
OL,13,FPrice's last success in their opening
OL,14,Fgame of 2026.
OL,16,FWith Price yet to claim a victory over
OL,17,FLittler in a game that has more than
OL,18,F15 legs, he must break new ground to
OL,19,Fwin the best-of-35 final.
